ime. After export the files are not being moved, and the autoload conversion happens at export time, so the path is always going to be valid.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6198223658/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6199009526","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122932#issuecomment-6199009526","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122932","id":6199009526,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcX1g9g","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T18:11:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T18:11:16Z","body":"I though it could get in the way of a patch PCK, but after actually testing it, it seems that autoloads are unpatchable, so the point is moot.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/